{"id": "De6TR9XP2dA", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"AGENCY\" to start building your own AI Agency inside Claude Code.\n\nYou can now run a whole agency for exactly zero dollars.\n\nIt does everything a real agency does.\n\nFrom finding clients to building the final product.\n\nIt's called Agency Agents.\n\nIt's a free and open source library of over 200 AI specialists.\n\nEach one has its own job and personality.\n\nIt has already crossed 160K stars on GitHub.\n\nInside, you get an outbound agent that writes your cold emails.\n\nA sales team that preps your calls and writes the proposal.\n\nAnd a team of engineers that builds the product for your client.\n\nPlus there are agents that help you grow your social media.\n\nOthers design your products, handle customer support and manage your finances.\n\nIt's like having a full agency staff that never asks for a paycheck.\n\nAnd an orchestrator agent runs the whole project.\n\nIt acts like the project manager for the whole team.\n\nIt verifies every step before it moves on.\n\nSo nothing slips through the cracks.\n\n#agencyagents #aiagency #claudecode #githubrepo #aiagents", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1792917721, "like_count": 1910, "comment_count": 3475, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1042904335475600a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 63.941, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-4.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNhYZDhomxyEKWkQO3pqHgRG-AEgrDCe-3qjh03rUFUSdWOAJOQ6QK6wQwyYf-AyzOU9m1elJnMZU0N0yOWczp11411VN-CTVywav0.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=Adp9bcCSEeVsFspXneeLpw5F_Xw0j2IUJipIHqL73djjkhjgmZDXu93VYW4zk_SG4uw&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-4.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=lscblkIDoRoQ7kNvwEcgs71&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=jC8JsltZ0TZ6O1FwvFUR1A&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28